      "content": "For the high-end luxury skincare line, I'd create a persona like this:\n\nName: Alexandra \"Alex\" Thompson\nAge: 32-45\nOccupation: High-powered executive, likely in finance or law\nLifestyle: Busy, affluent, and health-conscious, with a focus on wellness and self-care. She's probably a gym enthusiast, enjoys fine dining, and has a keen interest in fashion and beauty trends.\nCultural background: Upper-class, possibly with European or East Coast American roots. She's likely familiar with high-end brands and values exclusivity and prestige.\n\nFor the budget-friendly household cleaner line, I'd create a persona like this:\n\nName: Maria Rodriguez\nAge: 25-40\nOccupation: Working-class, possibly in service industry or manual labor\nLifestyle: Busy, practical, and budget-conscious, with a focus on getting the job done efficiently. She's probably a single parent, has a large family, and values affordability and convenience.\nCultural background: Latinx or Hispanic, possibly from a working-class background. She's likely familiar with DIY cleaning methods and values simplicity and value for money.",
